<<<
action, not the act, of a machine,

when we mean the way it acts; & action alone has the collective sense, as in his action throughout (i.e. his acts or actions as a whole) was correct; there are also other senses in which there is obviously no choice open.
===
*action*, not the *act*, of a machine, when we mean the way it *acts*; & *action* alone has the collective sense, as in *his action throughout* (i.e. his acts or actions as a whole) *was correct*; there are also other senses in which there is obviously no choice open.
>>>

